    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『今の自分の不甲斐なさに悔しがる自分』を\r\nテーマにできればと、考えています──",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040050"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私は──……このお話を頂いた時、\r\n自分を情けなく思いました",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アイドルとして──表現をする者として、\r\nすぐに何かを思いつく、ということができなくて……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……だからこそ、その『ありのままの自分』を",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンの方々に、特集を見てくださる方々に、\r\n知ってほしいと思ったんです",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──……この悔しさを忘れずに、\r\n必ず成長するための誓いとして",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
