  {
    "id": 2006012040110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンのみんなが望む私の姿ではないかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──それでも",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "みんなの前ではこういった面も見せられると──\r\n私たちに隔たりなどないのだと、そう伝えたいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……私が、アナタの隠したかった一面を垣間見て、\r\n嬉しく思ったように",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私を応援してくれるみんなにも\r\n……私を近く感じてほしい",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──なるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もちろん、不甲斐ないところだけ見せて\r\n終わりにするつもりはないよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "さらなる成長に向かうための……\r\nそうだな、宣誓のようなものさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012040180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今の私の実力を刻んで、もっと先へ繋げる──\r\nそんな一枚にするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601204/2006012040180"
  },
